msgid "Scan date (Only last changes or All history) - You can choose whether to retrieve only the most recent change or the entire history."
msgstr "Tarehe ya uchanganuzi (Mabadiliko ya mwisho pekee au Historia yote) - Unaweza kuchagua kurejesha mabadiliko ya hivi karibuni pekee au historia yote."

